{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:19793","original":"A character from [[Mahou Shoujo Madoka Magica]]. A mysterious and aloof girl who transfers to Mitakihara Middle School, encountering [[Kaname Madoka]] in the process, with intentions yet to be known to anyone.\r\n\r\nShe has [[long hair|long]] [[black hair]], [[purple eyes]], and wears a [[hairband]]. She can also be seen with [[twin braids]] held by dark [[purple ribbon]]s and [[red-framed eyewear]], [spoiler]particularly in the past timelines[/spoiler], the latter appearance often being nicknamed \"Moemura\" by the English speaking fandom. She is often seen in the [[Mitakihara school uniform]] with [[black pantyhose]] or [[black socks|black]] [[kneehighs]].\r\n\r\nWhen transformed into her [[magical girl|magical]] form, she wears a [[capelet]], a [[pleated skirt]], [[high heels|high heeled]] [[boots]] with [[argyle footwear|argyle]] patterns that cover the entire legs, and sometimes also has a [[shield]] on her lower left arm. She primarily uses mundane weapons such as guns and bombs. \r\n\r\n[spoiler]\r\nIt is later discovered that Homura's actions are due to her contract with [[Kyubey]] following the death of Madoka in a previous timeline. This has led her to create numerous timelines in order to avert Madoka's doom. Her shield acts like a seemingly infinite portable storage space for her weapons, and also allows her to manipulate and travel through time.\r\n[/spoiler]\r\n\r\nShe is voiced by [[Saitou Chiwa]] (Japanese) and [[Cristina Vee]] (English).\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !asset #49334072: [[Mitakihara school uniform]]\r\n* !asset #49334158: [[Akemi Homura (magical girl)|Magical Girl]]\r\n* !asset #49334232: [[Akuma Homura]]\r\n* !asset #49334243: [[Akemi Homura (black dress)|Black Dress]]\r\n* !post #6671297: [[Akemi Homura (Hideout Clothes)|Hideout Clothes]]\r\n* !asset #49333419: [[Akemi Homura (swimsuit ver.)|Swimsuit ver.]]\r\n* !asset #48533055: [[Akemi Homura (haregi ver.)|Haregi ver.]]\r\n* !asset #31364829: [[Akemi Homura (haregi costume)|Haregi Costume]]\r\n* !asset #48532987: [[Akemi Homura (winter costume)|Winter Costume]]\r\n* !post #1322986: [[Homurakko]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[Homulilly]]\r\n* [[homu]]\r\n* [[Time Tunnel (Madoka Magica)|]]\r\n* [[List of Mahou Shoujo Madoka Magica characters]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Puella Magi Wiki: Homura Akemi\":https://wiki.puella-magi.net/Homura_Akemi","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"akemi_homura"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:592924","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":592924},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:akemi_homura","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:57.010523+00:00","name":"akemi_homura","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:25530","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"wiki_tag_link","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":592924,"tag_key":{"kind":"t